<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in active trade on Friday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average rose 56.57 to 6,935.46. For the week, the Dow fell 65.43 points.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 1.83 to 417.70.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose 19 cents.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1,408 to 1,028.</p>
<p>Volume was 486,928,590 compared 503,737,090 on Thursday. Weekly volume totalled 2,446,718,590 shares.</p>
